        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. The company holds full IBA certification, ISO 9001:2015 quality management, and carries IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value. All moves comply with GST, e‑Way bill regulations, and are backed by a zero‑damage guarantee.</p>
      </div>
