        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical timeline for moving household goods from Banda to a major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard move from Banda to the nearest major hub (≈850 km) takes 2‑3 days of transit on dedicated multi‑axle trucks, plus one day for packing and loading and another day for unloading at the destination. Exact timing is confirmed during the pre‑move survey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my belongings in real time during the transit from Banda?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every truck in the fleet is equipped with satellite GPS, allowing customers to monitor the live location of their shipment via a secure portal. Real‑time updates include estimated arrival time, route deviations, and any handling alerts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What special precautions are taken for fragile items like glassware or temple idols?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Fragile items receive custom wooden crates, high‑density foam edge guards, and an extra layer of 80‑GSM bubble wrap within the 7‑layer system. Each piece is individually labeled, secured with ratchet lashings, and handled by trained personnel to prevent any vibration‑related damage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do Packers And Movers In Banda offer packing services for office equipment and corporate relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. In addition to residential moves, the team provides specialized corporate relocation services, including disassembly, packing of IT hardware, secure transport of servers, and re‑installation at the new office. All equipment is wrapped with anti‑static materials and placed on shock‑absorbing pallets.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I request an instant shifting quote for my move within Banda?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Visit the company’s website and click the ‘Instant Banda Shifting Quote’ button. Enter your pickup and delivery addresses, size of the move, and any optional services. Within minutes you’ll receive a downloadable estimate that includes all taxes, insurance, and any applicable surcharges.</p>
